t the size of the tail.\nNote the instructions block must exceed the model's minimum cacheable length (it is roughly 780 tokens by the note's\nestimate). If your model's minimum is higher (e.g. 1024), the first block will not be cached on its own. Check `usage` after deploying.\nE\npython3 -c \"import ast;ast.parse(open('bot.py').read())\""}},"tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01B4oPfG22YvnekQUf56dYwt","display_name":"Bash"}]}
